Now that's a damn good looking power play.

Puck retrievals, puck movement and the finish. Top unit of LaCombe, Carlsson, Gauthier, Granlund, Sennecke finds paydirt.

@SportingTrib | #FlyTogether

Great play for that fourth line on the forecheck. Washe takes it deep, Caulfield gets physical to hold it up, Washe digs the puck back out to Nesterenko for the finish.

Obviously Washe is a Duck, but good for Caulfield, Nesterenko to make impressions.

@SportingTrib | #FlyTogether

One more training camp practice for the Anaheim Ducks before their preseason finale in LA tomorrow afternoon.

McQueen, Klepov, Myatovic, Caulfield, Colangelo, Solberg, Warren, Mitchell among those still with the main group.

@SportingTrib | #FlyTogether

Kings grab the lead in the final minute. Two goals in 41 seconds.

Drew Doughty springs Joel Armia, and Armia wires this one. LA's NHLers putting them ahead.

@SportingTrib | #FlyTogether | #GoKingsGo

Ducks on the board first.

Great tracking back by Jayden Kurtz to get the puck, curl and send Anaheim back on the attack. Coulson Pitre finds Ethan Procyzsyn who fires, Judd Caulfield causes some crease chaos, and Procyzsyn finishes.

@SportingTrib | #FlyTogether

With all five of the Ducks regular captains not dressed tonight, three new A's on the ice for Anaheim:

Pavel Mintyukov, Ryan Poehling, Frank Vatrano

